  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Eliminate Y",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Multiply (1) by 3 and add (2).}\\\\[5pt]&6X-3Y=3M_1,\\quad X+3Y=M_2\\ \\Rightarrow\\ 7X=3M_1+M_2\\\\[5pt]&3M_1+M_2=\\begin{bmatrix}3&18&-9\\\\6&3&21\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4&3&2\\\\1&-3&0\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7&21&-7\\\\7&0&21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
